steps.human:
The server loads flows and hands serializable FlowsView props to the client. The visible list initially follows the client source/kind/realization filters; it is not an unfiltered promise that every flow appears at once. [Page handoff](leafcutter-web/app/flows/page.tsx) and [client filters](leafcutter-web/components/flows/flows-view.tsx).

